<title>USA: Puget Sound Energy unit sells trust prfds.</title>
<headline>Puget Sound Energy unit sells trust prfds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following 144A issue of trust preferred securities from Puget Sound Energy Capital Trust was priced on Thursday, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>The trust was created by parent company Puget Sound Energy.</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc was the lead manager.</p>
<p>BORROWER PUGET SOUND ENERGY CAPITAL TRUST</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	 COUPON 8.231 PCT  MATURITY 6/1/2027</p>
<p>TYPE TRUST PFD     ISS PRICE 100     FIRST PAY DATE 12/1/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA2  YIELD 8.231 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	 SPREAD 130 BP     CALLABLE NON CALL 10</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1678)</p>
</text>
